    "innerHTML": "<div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:#f0f6ff;\">\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:960px;height:56px;background:#0d2b6b;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 32px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n    <span style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;opacity:0.7;\">结果讨论与总结</span>\n    <span style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:13px;margin-left:auto;opacity:0.5;\">12 / 13</span>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;left:32px;top:72px;right:32px;bottom:24px;display:flex;gap:20px;\">\n    <!-- 左：结论 -->\n    <div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:900;color:#0d2b6b;\"><span style=\"display: contents;\"><span class=\"icon-replaced\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.125em;\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><polyline points=\"22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01\"></polyline></svg></span> 实验结论</span></div>\n      <div style=\"background:#f0fdf4;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;border-left:4px solid #059669;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#059669;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"display: contents;\"><span class=\"icon-replaced\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.125em;\"><path d=\"M6 9H4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H6\"></path><path d=\"M18 9h1.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5H18\"></path><path d=\"M4 22h16\"></path><path d=\"M10 22V18a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v4\"></path><path d=\"M18 2H6v7a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V2z\"></path></svg></span> 已达官方解决标准</span></div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#374151;line-height:1.7;\">\n          测试10轮平均得分 <strong>489.2 ≥ 475</strong>，CartPole-v1 任务成功解决\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:#eff6ff;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;border-left:4px solid #1a56db;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#374151;line-height:1.8;\">\n          <div><span style=\"display: contents;\"><span class=\"icon-replaced\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.125em;\"><path d=\"M3 21L8 14L13 17L21 3\"></path><polyline points=\"17 3 21 3 21 7\"></polyline></svg></span> 训练中 Avg(100)：23.2 → </span><strong>149.4</strong>（约6.4×提升）</div>\n          <div contenteditable=\"false\"><span style=\"display: contents;\"><span class=\"icon-replaced\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.125em;\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"6\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"4\"></rect><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"14\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg></span> 测试平均得分：</span><strong>489.2</strong>（约20×提升 vs 随机策略）</div>\n          <div><span contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"display: contents;\"><span class=\"icon-replaced\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.125em;\"><path d=\"M21 2l-2 2m-7.61 7.61a5.5 5.5 0 1 1-7.778 7.778 5.5 5.5 0 0 1 7.777-7.777zm0 0L15.5 7.5m0 0l3 3L22 7l-3-3m-3.5 3.5L19 4\"></path></svg></span> 经验回放 + 目标网络是稳定训练的关键机制</span></div>\n          <div><span style=\"display: contents;\"><span class=\"icon-replaced\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.125em;\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></span> 纯 CPU 训练，500轮完成，验证算法有效性</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- 右：改进方向 -->\n    <div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:900;color:#0d2b6b;\">🔧 局限与改进方向</div>\n      <div style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;border:1px solid #dbeafe;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;\">\n          <div style=\"background:#fef3c7;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 8px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#92400e;white-space:nowrap;\">局限</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\">训练阶段 Avg(100) 最高仅 125.1，未在训练中达标，需更多轮次</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;\">\n          <div style=\"background:#dbeafe;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 8px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#1e40af;white-space:nowrap;\">改进1</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong>Double DQN</strong>：分离动作选择与评估，减少 Q 值高估</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;\">\n          <div style=\"background:#dbeafe;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 8px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#1e40af;white-space:nowrap;\">改进2</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong>Dueling DQN</strong>：分离状态价值 V(s) 与动作优势 A(s,a)</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;\">\n          <div style=\"background:#dbeafe;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 8px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#1e40af;white-space:nowrap;\">改进3</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong>PER</strong>：优先经验回放，提升高 TD 误差样本的采样频率</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;\">\n          <div style=\"background:#dbeafe;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 8px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#1e40af;white-space:nowrap;\">改进4</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\">增加训练轮数至 <strong>1000+</strong>，使训练阶段也稳定达标</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
